answers.rag_answer:
Ela indica o tipo litológico:  
• amarelo – arenitos muito porosos;  
• verde – sedimentos clásticos finos;  
• azul – margas e calcilutitos.

For Sequence A a high-frequency stratigraphic framework was applied following the precepts of Modern Sequence Stratigraphy as set out by:

• Catuneanu (2006);  
• Catuneanu et al. (2009);  
• Hunt & Tucker (1992);  
• Van Wagoner et al. (1988);  
• Galloway (1989);  
• Posamentier & Allen (1999).
